Package: yazi
Version: 26.5.6-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 25957
Recommends: file, chafa, ffmpegthumbnailer, poppler-utils, fd-find, ripgrep, fzf, zoxide
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi
Description: Blazing fast terminal file manager (upstream binary repack)
 Yazi is a terminal file manager written in Rust, based on async I/O.
 Ships yazi (main UI) and ya (CLI helper / package manager).
 .
 Optional tools for preview support: chafa (images), ffmpegthumbnailer
 (video), poppler-utils (PDF), fd-find, ripgrep, fzf, zoxide.
 .
 This package repackages the upstream musl pre-built binary release.
